{"verse_key": "13:42", "surah": 13, "verse": 42, "text_uthmani": "وَقَدْ مَكَرَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ فَلِلَّهِ ٱلْمَكْرُ جَمِيعًا ۖ يَعْلَمُ مَا تَكْسِبُ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ ۗ وَسَيَعْلَمُ ٱلْكُفَّـٰرُ لِمَنْ عُقْبَى ٱلدَّارِ", "translation": "And those before them had plotted, but to Allāh belongs the plan entirely. He knows what every soul earns, and the disbelievers will know for whom is the final home.", "verse_from_ms": 1032500, "verse_to_ms": 1050990, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَقَدْ", "start_ms": 1032500, "end_ms": 1033480}, {"i": 1, "text": "مَكَرَ", "start_ms": 1033480, "end_ms": 1034040}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "start_ms": 1034040, "end_ms": 1035080}, {"i": 3, "text": "مِن", "start_ms": 1035080, "end_ms": 1035850}, {"i": 4, "text": "قَبْلِهِمْ", "start_ms": 1035850, "end_ms": 1036780}, {"i": 5, "text": "فَلِلَّهِ", "start_ms": 1036780, "end_ms": 1037920}, {"i": 6, "text": "ٱلْمَكْرُ", "start_ms": 1037920, "end_ms": 1038740}, {"i": 7, "text": "جَمِيعًا", "start_ms": 1038740, "end_ms": 1040550}, {"i": 8, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1040550, "end_ms": 1041460}, {"i": 9, "text": "يَعْلَمُ", "start_ms": 1041460, "end_ms": 1041720}, {"i": 10, "text": "مَا", "start_ms": 1041720, "end_ms": 1042540}, {"i": 11, "text": "تَكْسِبُ", "start_ms": 1042540, "end_ms": 1043210}, {"i": 12, "text": "كُلُّ", "start_ms": 1043210, "end_ms": 1044110}, {"i": 13, "text": "نَفْسٍ", "start_ms": 1044110, "end_ms": 1045800}, {"i": 14, "text": "ۗ", "start_ms": 1045800, "end_ms": 1046940}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَسَيَعْلَمُ", "start_ms": 1046940, "end_ms": 1047480}, {"i": 16, "text": "ٱلْكُفَّـٰرُ", "start_ms": 1047480, "end_ms": 1048120}, {"i": 17, "text": "لِمَنْ", "start_ms": 1048120, "end_ms": 1049230}, {"i": 18, "text": "عُقْبَى", "start_ms": 1049230, "end_ms": 1050825}, {"i": 19, "text": "ٱلدَّارِ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}